  },
  {
    id: 2, cat: 'Before You Decide',
    title: 'Understand what the SCV does and does not allow',
    desc: 'The SCV lets you live and work in Australia indefinitely — but it has real restrictions most Kiwis don\'t know about. You cannot: sponsor family members for migration visas, access most Centrelink payments (with limited exceptions), apply directly for citizenship (you must first get permanent residency), or vote in federal elections. Understanding these limits before you move prevents nasty surprises.',
    docs: [],
    cost: 'Free',
